# The counter above the shell (roadmap l4.md L2): a program that never waits
# starves every thread below it, and only those. The shell never runs, while
# the kernel goes on: its ticks end the test.
program: shell
define: TEST_COUNTER_ABOVE
define: TEST_THREAD_REPORT
define: TEST_END_TICKS=100
---
rx286, test build
rx286: thread program did not run
rx286: thread counter ran
